Z||000007||286SE'S||09-14-2000||03:34 PM||||I suspect that some of this is true: That GM and Pontiac want the Fiero to "go away".<BR> Everytime I took my car to the dealer for service they seem to cause some sort of damage to to the car, perhaps to get me pissed off at it and get rid of it? So far they cracked my exterior door panel and tail light lense, Let all the freon out of the AC. left bolts and parts in the trunk that they "forgot about" and told me there were all kinds of problems with the car that were total lies. The worst thing they did was burn a hole in my drivers seat, ashes all over the console.I complained and hey said I did it and I have never smoked. Are all dealers this evil? I see other customers getting 'red carpet' treatments, while waiting in their lobby, that I have never gotten. I will never go back to one but its hard to avoid when they are 3 blocks away.<BR>Terry<BR>||||reg||1
