Z||000010||Oreif||09-15-2000||02:17 AM||||GM mechs are like picking a number on a roulette table. Sure eventually you'll find one worth your time but not often. I took a car (non-fiero) to "Mr. Goodwrench" to change a heater core. Got the car back and it ran like S**T. Took it back twice. Then I took it to another dealership. Found out the first mech screwed up all the vacuum lines! The ones he didn't know where they went he just plugged them or stuck them where he "thought" they went. ||||reg||1
